      "side": 1,
      "message": "Pat, Winson: sorry for springing this on you without prior discussion.\n\nWe face a lot of difficult-to-debug issues from mainline tests, and need more data in the bugreports.\n\nThe data we need originates from derive_sdk, but that\u0027s a binary that runs (and exists) early during boot, so can\u0027t be used. apexd would be a good candidate to hold the data, but that service is also killed early.\n\nThe package manager felt like the next best candidate. WDTY?",
      "revId": "46c545282f6ef47ab51db4fc545ae8a67b090302",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
