      "writtenOn": "2022-09-16T12:18:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not sure if we should be doing file IO during dump (time + potentially unstable system if dump is triggered because of a crash). Would it be better to read the data when the package manager starts and keep it cached in memory throughout the package manager\u0027s lifetime?",
